avel Information section of our online brochure at https://bit.ly/38OuBcF","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":328.5176810337974,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":36.0,"r":279.36108,"t":392.21676000000014},"charspan":[0,300],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/12","text":"Symposia Medicus has arranged for discount fares with Alaska, Delta, and United Airlines for this conference. To view more information, including airline discount codes, please visit the Conference Registration, Lodging, and Travel Information section of our online brochure at https://bit.ly/38OuBcF"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"GROUND TRANSPORTATION OPTIONS","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":306.4929590569745,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":36.0,"r":217.55148,"t":315.78768},"charspan":[0,29],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/13","text":"GROUND TRANSPORTATION OPTIONS"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Option #1 - Car Rental","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":284.65533905697447,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":36.0,"r":140.517,"t":293.95006},"charspan":[0,22],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/14","text":"Option #1 - Car Rental"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"We recommend that you rent a car to see the many sites of Tucson and the surrounding area. Symposia Medicus has arranged conference discounts with AVIS and Budget Car Rentals. Reservations can be made online or by phone. Please refer to the conference code and the airport location when making your reservations.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":207.32632103379717,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":36.0,"r":287.40349199999974,"t":272.09146},"charspan":[0,312],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/15","text":"We recommend that you rent a car to see the many sites of Tucson and the surrounding area. Symposia Medicus has arranged conference discounts with AVIS and Budget Car Rentals. Reservations can be made online or by phone. Please refer to the conference code and the airport location when making your reservations."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"For driving directions from the Tucson International Airport (TUS), please visit https://goo.gl/maps/JbvRG4rqCaUZuehq9","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":88.52428103379725,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":36.0,"r":283.6782719999998,"t":119.34672},"charspan":[0,118],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/16","text":"For driving directions from the Tucson International Airport (TUS), please visit https://goo.gl/maps/JbvRG4rqCaUZuehq9"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"For driving directions from the Phoenix Sky Harbor International Airport (PHX), please visit https://goo.gl/maps/V7AbPevBcjsh3d3V8","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":44.84428103379719,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":36.0,"r":251.40076799999994,"t":75.66671999999994},"charspan":[0,130],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/17","text":"For driving directions from the Phoenix Sky Harbor International Airport (PHX), please visit https://goo.gl/maps/V7AbPevBcjsh3d3V8"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Option #2 - Uber or Lyft","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":557.7729590569744,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":434.87523600000014,"t":567.06768},"charspan":[0,24],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/18","text":"Option #2 - Uber or Lyft"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","enumerated":false,"hyperlink":"http://www.uber.com/","label":"list_item","marker":"·","orig":"· www.uber.com","parent":{"$ref":"#/groups/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":535.5247610337972,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":407.51544,"t":544.50768},"charspan":[0,14],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/19","text":"www.uber.com"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","enumerated":false,"hyperlink":"http://www.lyft.com/","label":"list_item","marker":"·","orig":"· www.lyft.com","parent":{"$ref":"#/groups/1"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":513.0871610337972,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.00444,"r":400.55544000000003,"t":522.06948},"charspan":[0,14],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/20","text":"www.lyft.com"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Option #3 - Taxi","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":490.9319990569745,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":400.077,"t":500.22672000000006},"charspan":[0,16],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/21","text":"Option #3 - Taxi"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"VIP Taxi and Yellow Cab are under contract with the Tucson Airport Authority (TAA) to meet arriving flights.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":458.3600810337973,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":556.91412,"t":478.2615600000001},"charspan":[0,108],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/22","text":"VIP Taxi and Yellow Cab are under contract with the Tucson Airport Authority (TAA) to meet arriving flights."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"To reach the cab stand from the main terminal (A and B gates), exit Baggage Claim on the lower level and cross the first roadway to the second roadway where taxis should be to your left. From the C gates, cross the roadway and go east toward the main terminal where you will find the taxis on your left as you near the center of the parking area. If there are no taxis, please use the phone at the cab stand to have one dispatched immediately.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":360.0871610337972,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":577.0790280000006,"t":445.50768000000005},"charspan":[0,443],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/23","text":"To reach the cab stand from the main terminal (A and B gates), exit Baggage Claim on the lower level and cross the first roadway to the second roadway where taxis should be to your left. From the C gates, cross the roadway and go east toward the main terminal where you will find the taxis on your left as you near the center of the parking area. If there are no taxis, please use the phone at the cab stand to have one dispatched immediately."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Under the contracts with the TAA, taxi rates are set at $5.50 to start and $2.25 per mile with a $12.00 minimum fare. There can also be a charge for traffic delays of up to $22.00 per hour. There are no additional charges for up to three passengers or normal baggage.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":294.5671610337972,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":578.5180920000007,"t":347.22768},"charspan":[0,267],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/24","text":"Under the contracts with the TAA, taxi rates are set at $5.50 to start and $2.25 per mile with a $12.00 minimum fare. There can also be a charge for traffic delays of up to $22.00 per hour. There are no additional charges for up to three passengers or normal baggage."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"ADDITIONAL TRANSPORTATION OPTIONS","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":272.5329590569745,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":521.99928,"t":281.82768000000004},"charspan":[0,33],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/25","text":"ADDITIONAL TRANSPORTATION OPTIONS"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"For additional transportation options, please contact the concierge at Loews Ventana Canyon Resort at (520) 299-2020.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":229.0411410337972,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":560.7639480000003,"t":259.86357999999996},"charspan":[0,117],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/26","text":"For additional transportation options, please contact the concierge at Loews Ventana Canyon Resort at (520) 299-2020."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"PARKING","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":206.8929590569744,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":370.43304,"t":216.18768},"charspan":[0,7],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/27","text":"PARKING"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Self and valet parking are complimentary for conference guests.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":174.32524103379728,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":324.0,"r":562.2020640000002,"t":194.22672},"charspan":[0,63],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/28","text":"Self and valet parking are complimentary for conference guests."}],"version":"1.10.0"}